      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha makamanda wote wa majeshi, Yohanani mwana wa Karea, na Azaria",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azaria:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania: Yezania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mwana wa Heshaia pamoja na watu wote, wadogo kwa wakubwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamwendea Yeremia, wakamwambia, “Tafadhali sikiliza maombi yetu na kutuombea dua kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, sisi sote tuliosalia (kwa maana tulikuwa wengi, lakini sasa tumebaki wachache tu, kama uonavyo). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, na atuoneshe njia anayotaka tuifuate, na kile anachotaka tukifanye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia akawajibu, “Vema; nimesikia. Nitamwomba Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, kama mlivyonisihi; jibu lolote atakalonipa Mwenyezi-Mungu, nitawaambieni; sitawaficha chochote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, watu wakamwambia Yeremia, “Mwenyezi-Mungu na awe shahidi wa kweli na mwaminifu dhidi yetu ikiwa hatutafanya jinsi Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako atakavyokuagiza utuambie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe ni jambo la kupendeza au la, sisi tutaitii sauti ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu ambaye tunakutuma kwake ili tufanikiwe tutakapomtii Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya siku kumi, neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilimjia Yeremia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yeremia akamwita Yohanani mwana wa Karea, na makamanda wote wa majeshi pamoja na watu wote, wadogo kwa wakubwa, akawaambia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli ambaye mlinituma kwake nipeleke maombi yenu, asema hivi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama mtabaki katika nchi hii, basi, nitawajenga, wala sitawabomoa; nitawaotesha wala sitawangoa; kwa maana nitabadili nia kwa sababu ya maafa niliyowatenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msimwogope mfalme wa Babuloni mnayemwogopa; naam, msimwogope hata kidogo. Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nimesema. Mimi niko pamoja nanyi kuwaokoeni na kuwasalimisha kutoka mikononi mwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawahurumieni na kumfanya mfalme awahurumie na kuwaacha nchini mwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lakini mkisema: ‘Hatutaki kubaki katika nchi hii,’ na hivyo mkaacha kutii sauti ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kusema kwamba mtakwenda kukaa nchini Misri, ambako hamtaona vita wala kusikia sauti ya tarumbeta wala kukosa chakula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, sikilizeni asemavyo Mwenyezi-Mungu enyi mabaki ya Yuda. Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli, asema hivi: Kama mmekusudia kuingia nchini Misri na kukaa huko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, vita mnavyoviogopa vitawakumba hukohuko Misri, na njaa mnayoihofia itawaandama vikali hadi Misri, na mtafia hukohuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wote wenye nia ya kwenda kukaa Misri watakufa kwa njaa na maradhi mabaya wala hakuna hata mmoja wao atakayebaki au kunusurika kutokana na maafa nitakayowaletea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Maana mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wa Israeli, nasema hivi: Kama vile hasira yangu na ghadhabu yangu ilivyowapata wakazi wa Yerusalemu, ndivyo ghadhabu yangu itakavyowapata nyinyi, kama mtakwenda Misri. Mtakuwa kitu cha kutukanwa, kitisho, laana na aibu. Hamtapaona tena mahali hapa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia akawaambia watu: “Enyi Wayahudi mliosalia, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwaambia msiende Misri. Jueni wazi kwamba leo nimewaonya kuwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mmepotoka, mmeyahatarisha maisha yenu. Maana mlinituma kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, mkiniambia, ‘Tuombee dua kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, na chochote Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu atakachosema, utuambie, nasi tutatekeleza.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leo mimi nimewaambieni lakini hamkutii chochote ambacho Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu amenituma niwaambie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, jueni hakika kwamba mahali mnapotamani kwenda kukaa mtafia hukohuko kwa vita, njaa na maradhi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
